:
Reporting directly to the Senior Manager Advertising & Digital Marketing, the incumbent of this position will fulfil the necessary requirements within the Marketing Division to support Marketing Communications functions for a wide portfolio of Toyota and related products, with specific focus on end-to-end campaign management to support product introductions.
This role requires a candidate that can seamlessly manage projects from inception to the post-review stage and is able to foster relations with key suppliers and agencies in order to execute campaigns successfully. Sound product knowledge of the Toyota range is essential, as well as insight into marketing trends, competitor activity, and various media landscapes.
