High level of Risk Engineering technical expertise
Degree (or equivalent) and risk management qualifications or relevant accreditations
Comfortable travelling extensively (e.g. 80-95 days per year) both within and / or outside of South Africa
Self-starter, with good interpersonal skills and the ability to effectively relate to individuals at all levels – from site technicians up to company CEOs
Proven ability to write detailed reports of a varied technical nature
Experience of carrying out property risk surveys
The flexibility to work in a range of physical locations, some uncomfortable.
Driver’s license and care is a necessity
Negotiating and influencing skills with the ability to handle occasional conflict situations;
